scenario: A11Y-01
title: Screen reader and text size
area: Access
rows: F-A11Y-05
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: Speakers working.
step: Open Settings, Accessibility and switch on the screen reader.
expect: The page is read aloud, starting with its title.
clause: reader
step: Move through the page with Tab.
expect: Every control you reach is spoken with its name and its state.
clause: tab
step: Switch on the largest text size.
expect: Every screen of Settings stays readable with nothing cut off.
clause: size
